    "final_answer": "## Task Complete\n\nI found a men's leather wallet on Amazon that meets all your criteria:\n\n### **Artpaxy Mens Wallet Genuine Leather Bifold RFID Blocking Wallet**\n- **URL**: https://www.amazon.com/Artpaxy-Genuine-Leather-Blocking-Holders/dp/B0CYXBBDYC\n- **Price**: $31.99 ✓ (below $50)\n- **Card Slots**: 13 Card Holders ✓ (well above 6)\n- **RFID Blocking**: Yes ✓ (RFID Protected feature)\n- **Material**: Genuine Leather\n- **Rating**: 4.6/5 stars (2,669 reviews)\n\n### FREE Delivery Status:\n**Yes, but conditionally**:\n- ✅ **With Amazon Prime**: FREE delivery Tomorrow, September 18\n- ⚠️ **Without Prime**: FREE delivery Tuesday, September 22 is available, but only on orders shipped by Amazon **over $35**. Since this wallet alone is $31.99 (just $3.01 short of the threshold), it would NOT qualify for free shipping on its own. You would need to add another small item to reach $35, or add a second wallet (e.g., another color at $31.99) to qualify.\n\nThis wallet is an excellent match — it's a top-rated, popular product (800+ bought in past month) with genuine leather, RFID blocking, and ample card storage well exceeding your 6-slot minimum.",
